# IncuBrix AI Background Music Engine for Video

Original, commercially safe instrumental music that fits a video exactly — with real instrument stems, sample-accurate duration alignment, and ITU-R BS.1770-4 loudness compliance.

---

## 1. System Architecture

```
                             +-------------------------------+
                             |    IncuBrix Video Creator     |
                             |   (Client / Video Editor)     |
                             +-------------------------------+
                                             |
                                             | HTTP POST /api/v1/music/jobs
                                             v
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                       |               FastAPI Gateway               |
                       |  - Validates OpenAPI 3.1 Request Payload    |
                       |  - Enforces Idempotency-Key Header          |
                       |  - Blocks SSRF against Private/Internal IPs |
                       |  - Rate Limiting (60 req/min per IP)        |
                       |  - Request Body Caps (Max 50 MB)            |
                       |  - Demo Access Protection (DEMO_API_KEY)    |
                       |  - Emits Structured JSON Logs + Correlation |
                       |  - Returns HTTP 202 Accepted + job_id       |
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                                             |
                        +--------------------+--------------------+
                        | (In-process Queue)                      | (Celery Queue)
                        v                                         v
         +-----------------------------+           +-----------------------------+
         |     Async Worker Thread     |           |     Celery Audio Worker     |
         +-----------------------------+           +-----------------------------+
                        \                                         /
                         \                                       /
                          v                                     v
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                       |              Audio Generation               |
                       |  - Soundverse Enterprise (v7 Demucs 6-stem) |
                       |  - ElevenLabs Music API (music_v2)          |
                       |  - Mock Provider (Offline Synthetic Audio)  |
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                                             |
                                             v
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                       |          Local DSP & Audio Engine           |
                       |  - 48 kHz 24-bit PCM WAV Transcoding        |
                       |  - Sample-Accurate Duration (|Δt| <= 0.05s) |
                       |  - Cosine Musical Tail (No Truncation Pops) |
                       |  - ITU-R BS.1770-4 Loudness (-16 LUFS)      |
                       |  - True Peak Limiting (<= -1.0 dBTP)        |
                       |  - Voiceover Sidechain Ducking (-10 dB)     |
                       |  - Mathematical Stem Reconstruction (SDR)   |
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                                             |
                                             v
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                       |        MinIO S3 / Object Storage            |
                       |  - mix.wav, mix.mp3                         |
                       |  - stems/drums.wav, bass.wav, harmony...    |
                       |  - mix_ducked.wav (when voiceover provided) |
                       |  - music_manifest.json                      |
                       |  - validation_report.json                   |
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                                             |
                                             v
                       +---------------------------------------------+
                       |       HMAC-SHA256 Webhook Callback          |
                       |  (Signed with X-IncuBrix-Signature header)  |
                       +---------------------------------------------+
```

---

## 2. Quickstart Setup (Under 10 Commands)

### Option A: Local Development & Automated Test Execution (Zero External Keys Required)

```bash
# 1. Clone repository
git clone <repo-url> && cd audio-gen

# 2. Install dependencies
pip install -r requirements.txt

# 3. Run full automated test suite (67 tests, 100% offline)
pytest tests/ -v

# 4. Start FastAPI development server
uvicorn src.main:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000

# 5. In a separate terminal, run frontend dashboard
cd frontend && npm install && npm run dev -- --port 3000
```

### Option B: One-Command Docker Compose Deployment

```bash
# 1. Copy environment template
cp .env.example .env

# 2. Build and launch all 6 services (Frontend, FastAPI, Celery, PostgreSQL, Redis, MinIO)
docker compose up --build

# 3. Access interfaces:
# - Web Dashboard (Audio Studio): http://localhost:3000
# - API Interactive Docs (OpenAPI): http://localhost:8000/docs
# - MinIO S3 Console: http://localhost:9001 (User/Pass: minioadmin / minioadmin)
```

---

## 3. Automated Batch Test Runner

Execute reproducible end-to-end API validations, download outputs, and run independent DSP verification:

```bash
python scripts/batch_runner.py --inputs-dir test_inputs --api-url http://localhost:8000 --output-dir artifacts/test_results
```

The runner:
1. Submits all JSON test vectors from `test_inputs/`.
2. Polls asynchronous jobs until terminal status (`succeeded` or `failed`).
3. Downloads all generated assets (`mix.wav`, `stems/*.wav`, `music_manifest.json`).
4. Runs independent ITU-R BS.1770-4 loudness, True Peak, duration, and SDR validation.
5. Emits consolidated results in `artifacts/test_results/test_summary.md` (**15 / 15 Passed**).

---

## 4. Key Empirical Benchmark Metrics

Obtained via [`scripts/measure_benchmarks.py`](file:///c:/audio-gen/scripts/measure_benchmarks.py) on a 60-second reference track:

| Benchmark Metric | Measured Result | Evaluation Gate |
| :--- | :---: | :---: |
| **Cold Start Generation (60s Track)** | **10.89s** | Sub-15s startup |
| **Warm API Roundtrip (60s Track)** | **12.12s** (Worker elapsed: 2.15s) | Sub-15s response |
| **Maximum Duration Error** | **0.0000s** (0 samples drift) | Target $\pm 0.05$s |
| **Integrated Loudness** | **-16.00 LUFS** | Target $-16.0 \pm 1.0$ LU |
| **4x Oversampled True Peak** | **-3.09 dBTP** | Ceiling $\le -1.0$ dBTP |
| **Stem Reconstruction SDR** | **114.38 dB** | Minimum $\ge 20.0$ dB |
| **Max Stem Inter-Correlation (Leakage)** | **0.009** | Differentiated instruments |
| **Concurrency (5 Parallel Jobs)** | **100.0% Success (5/5)** | No race conditions |
| **Automated Test Suite Pass Rate** | **67 / 67 Passed (100%)** | 0 Failures |

