## 5. API Reference & OpenAPI 3.1 Specification

Root OpenAPI documentation is maintained at [`openapi.yaml`](file:///c:/audio-gen/openapi.yaml) and served live at `/docs`.

### Core Endpoints

* `POST /api/v1/music/jobs` — Submit asynchronous music generation job. Requires `Idempotency-Key` header. Returns HTTP 202 with `job_id`.
* `GET /api/v1/jobs/{job_id}` — Poll job state, progress percentage (0–100), timing metrics, and asset download URLs.
* `GET /api/v1/jobs` — Paginated history of generated jobs.
* `GET /health` — Liveness probe (`{"status": "ok"}`).
* `GET /ready` — Readiness probe verifying database and storage connectivity.

